<div class="content">
  <h1>${$global.title}</h1>
  <div class="content-body" no-parse>
    <h1 id="build-configuration" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#build-configuration">#</a> Build Configuration</h1>
<p>Configure how MarkoPress builds your site.</p>
<h2 id="output-directory" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#output-directory">#</a> Output Directory</h2>
<p>Customize the build output:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">build</span><span style="color:#24292E">: {</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">  outDir</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#032F62">'dist'</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">}</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="minification" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#minification">#</a> Minification</h2>
<p>Control HTML/CSS/JS minification:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">build</span><span style="color:#24292E">: {</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">  minify</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">true</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">  minifyHtml</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">true</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">  minifyCss</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">true</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">}</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="source-maps" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#source-maps">#</a> Source Maps</h2>
<p>Generate source maps for debugging:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">build</span><span style="color:#24292E">: {</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">  sourcemap</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">true</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">}</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="clean-build" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#clean-build">#</a> Clean Build</h2>
<p>Clean output directory before build:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">build</span><span style="color:#24292E">: {</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">  clean</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">true</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">}</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="build-performance" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#build-performance">#</a> Build Performance</h2>
<p>Optimize build performance:</p>
<ul>
<li>Incremental builds (default)</li>
<li>Parallel processing</li>
<li>Cache optimization</li>
</ul>
<p>For large sites:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">build</span><span style="color:#24292E">: {</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">  parallel</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">true</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">  cache</span><span style="color:#24292E">: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">true</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">}</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="deployment" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#deployment">#</a> Deployment</h2>
<p>MarkoPress outputs static HTML ready for deployment to:</p>
<ul>
<li>GitHub Pages</li>
<li>Netlify</li>
<li>Vercel</li>
<li>AWS S3</li>
<li>Any static hosting</li>
</ul>
<p>See also:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="/docs/advanced/overview">Advanced Features Overview</a></li>
<li><a href="/docs/configuration">Configuration Guide</a></li>
</ul>

  </div>
</div>
